Flower launches into the air, twin fire jets blasting from her boots, while I channel my air currents to lift off behind her.

The currents wobble under my ribs, fighting for balance, but with one point in magical stats I take what I can get.

Ahead of us, Daren and Hadrik have turned the highway into a disaster zone. Half the pines along the verge lie splintered or shorn by Daren's floating steel, and Eiden drifts through the wreckage with effortless grace, barely tapping his deeper reserves.

When Flower draws near, Illuna conjures three water lances and hurls them downward. Eiden raises his right palm, flash-boiling the projectiles into steam with a torrent of white flame.

