ID: B3-Ch12b-Washing
TEXT:

set(v_is_dead,1) if (v_b3_ch12_hadrik == 0 && v_b3_ch12_scout != 3 || v_b3_ch12_hadrik == 1)
set(v_is_dead,0) if (v_b3_ch12_hadrik == 0 && v_b3_ch12_scout == 3)
#if(v_b3_ch12_hadrik == 1 && v_b3_ch12_scout != 3) {
"Illuna, dish-washing spell on Eiden!" I shout.

"The timing is unstable," Illuna warns.

"Trust me, drop it now!"

"Fine," Illuna mutters. "Do not complain when the weave collapses."

She casts, locking a water sphere over Eiden's head while he parries Hadrik. Eiden flinches, but instead of drowning, he begins rapid micro-teleports across the glade. The rapid displacement breaks Illuna's sensory lock, and the water sphere collapses into droplets.

A heartbeat later, Eiden materializes beside my shoulder, his expression dark.

}
#if(v_b3_ch12_hadrik == 0 && v_b3_ch12_scout != 3) {
"Illuna, dish-washing spell on Eiden!" I shout.

"The timing is unstable," Illuna warns.

"Trust me, drop it now!"

"Fine," Illuna mutters. "Do not complain when the weave collapses."

She casts, locking a water sphere over Eiden's head. Eiden flinches, but instead of drowning, he begins rapid micro-teleports across the glade. The rapid displacement breaks Illuna's sensory lock, and the water sphere collapses into droplets.

A heartbeat later, Eiden materializes beside my shoulder, his expression dark.

}
#if(v_b3_ch12_hadrik == 1 && v_b3_ch12_scout == 3) {
"Illuna, dish-washing spell on Eiden!" I shout.

"The timing is unstable," Illuna warns.

"Trust me, drop it now!"

"At least let me draw from the amplifier in Hadrik's pack," Illuna says.

"A bit occupied at the moment!" Hadrik yells, ducking under Eiden's fire sweep. "Manage without it!"

"Fine," Illuna mutters. "Do not complain when the weave collapses."

She casts, locking a water sphere over Eiden's head while he fights Hadrik. Eiden flinches, but instead of drowning, he begins rapid micro-teleports across the glade. The rapid displacement breaks Illuna's sensory lock, and the water sphere collapses into droplets.

A heartbeat later, Eiden materializes beside my shoulder, his expression dark.

}
#if(v_b3_ch12_hadrik == 0 && v_b3_ch12_scout == 3) {
"Illuna, dish-washing spell on Eiden!" I shout.

"The timing is unstable," Illuna warns.

"Trust me, drop it now!"

"At least let me draw from the amplifier in Hadrik's pack," Illuna says.

"Got it right here!" Hadrik calls from the roadside, hauling the bronze sphere from his pack and lobbing it toward Illuna as she descends.

"Don't throw it!" Illuna yells, catching the heavy bronze core mid-air, nearly knocking her off her flight balance.

She touches down, plants the amplifier in the grass, and channels the matrix.

"Dish-washing spells? Repurposed teleporters?" Eiden watches from above, his amusement returning. "Reason dictates I interrupt this circus, yet curiosity stays my hand..."

"You're going to love it," I call out.

The water sphere condenses over Eiden's head, dense and pressurized. He grimaces as fluid floods his nostrils. He attempts rapid teleportation bursts across the clearing to shake the lock, but Daren's amplifier feeds Illuna's aura directly, keeping the water sphere tethered to his neck through every jump.

Gasping for air, Eiden conjures a localized whirlwind around his torso. The violent vortex shreds the water sphere into mist.

Eiden cancels the gale and drops to the cobblestones on one knee, pressing a hand to his forehead as vertigo overwhelms him.

The opening is here.

}
#if(v_b3_ch12_hadrik == 1 || v_b3_ch12_scout != 3) {
"I must confess, Barry," Eiden says, his voice dangerously level. "That parlor trick irritated me."

I snap a lightning bolt at his face, but he vanishes before the arc connects.

I spin, blasting fire into the empty air behind me to catch an invisible silhouette, but the heat finds nothing.

A hand locks onto the back of my skull from above. Concussive force detonates inward, ending my life in an instant.

}
