#if(v_b3_ch11_red == 0 && v_b3_ch12_hadrik == 0) {
Time to trigger the contingency. Meridith mapped a back-door bypass in the stat booster, a single opportunity to siphon Eiden's ambient reserve before his wards recognize the tap.

I pull the device from my belt, striking the primary rune three times in rapid succession.

"Adjusting your stats in the middle of a duel?" Eiden smiles, unimpressed. "You must know that no matter what you allocate, it won't—"

The aura siphon bites. Eiden's eyes snap wide as his mana bleeds into my conduits, and he lashes out with an instant fire blast.

}
#if(v_b3_ch11_red == 0 && v_b3_ch12_hadrik == 1) {
