My flight currents drag, leaving me square in the path of the thermal jet. The white fire washes over my torso, but my maxed Aura Hardening absorbs the heat, keeping my body whole through the blaze.

Raw stillwater energy floods into my stat matrix, unlocking the grand Tier-5 spell arrays from the dragon duel. I channel the heaviest bombardment in the catalog.

A blazing meteor condenses in the upper atmosphere, dropping like a falling mountain directly onto Eiden's head. The impact drives him straight into the cobblestones, detonating a massive shockwave across the valley as the stolen charge burns itself out.

Eiden stumbles to his feet from the smoking crater, singed and reeling.

Before he can steady his footing, Illuna snaps a dense sphere of water over his head. The sudden immersion catches him mid-breath; he thrashes in the dirt, gasping and coughing against the pressurized fluid.

}
#if(v_b3_ch11_red == 1) {
